 sans-serif; width: 90.29pt; height: 32.48pt; border-width: 0.25pt 0.25pt 1.7pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">미운영</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 26.6pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -26.6pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -26.6pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -26.6pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt;\">코로나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -26.6pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt;\">19&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -26.6pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt;\">상황 및 대학 방침에 따라 운영시간과 내용이 변경될 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 26.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -26.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; text-indent: -26.6pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 26.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -26.6pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">발열측정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 15pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">:&nbsp;도서관 1,2층 출입문(출입관리시스템) 이용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 26.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -26.6pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;전자출입명부 인증 확인(QR코드 인식) → 열감지카메라 발열 측정 → 입장(37.5℃ 이하, 마스크 착용자)</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 97.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -97.6pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">◦</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">준수사항&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 15pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">&nbsp;거리두기 준수, 올바른 마스크 착용,&nbsp; 손 소독, 예약 좌석 이용</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 145.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -145.6pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">지역주민&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 15pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">외부 이용자(지역주민 등) 출입 제한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">도서대출 회원은 온라인 안심대출 이용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 145.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -145.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -130.133px; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 15pt;\">◦</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-indent: -130.133px; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -130.133px; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">졸 업 생 : 도서관 3층 대출실에서 일반열람실 이용자 등록 후 이용 가능</span><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 26.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -26.6pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold;\">퇴관조치</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 15pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">: 발열자,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">마스크 미착용자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">미지정 좌석 이용자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">거리두기 미이행자, 음식 섭취자(물 허용) 등 방역수칙 위반자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 26.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 24.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -26.6pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;☎</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.133333px; text-indent: -130.133px;\">연락처 : 도서관 열람팀 (054-478) 7167~8, 에스원통합상황실 7101~2, 도자모 6815&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
